				"## <grad from=#B47CFF to=#E3D0FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>收集它们</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>有一定几率掉落你刚刚杀死生物的生蛋。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>搭配攻击增幅单元，Meka-Tool 将成为怪物农场中非常实用的储备方案。</grad></shadow>"
