		{
			dependencies: ["566EC8422DD63704"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>这把剑</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>50</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 单个模块前，每挥动一次的基础伤害为 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>625,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"右键可让你向上瞬移最多 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格，每 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>5,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点，使其更像移动工具而非武器。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>值得拥有的模组</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>攻击增幅</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 乘以基础值五十倍。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>Sweeping</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 增加了横扫攻击，造成额外 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>125,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>Looting</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 额外增加 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>125,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的掠夺等级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 无法附魔。模块就是附魔本身。"
			]
			id: "7418CEBAA7B93545"
			min_width: 340
			shape: "star"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FF6ECF>五十点伤害，模组前</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5B5620C69251CD85"
				item: "mekaweapons:mekatana"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6>Meka-Tana</grad></shadow>"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["566EC8422DD63704"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>弓</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>50</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 基础伤害，根据箭矢落地时的速度进行缩放，每支箭消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>625,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>火焰模式消耗 </grad><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>825,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 资源，而非其他。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>值得拥有的模组</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>能量箭矢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 使其无需弹药即可发射。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>绘制速度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>缩短每次拉动的距离，每级生效。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>重力阻尼器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 完全移除了箭矢掉落物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.8>自动开火</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 按住按钮即可持续开火。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>伤害随箭速变化，所以绘制速度和重力阻尼不仅仅是为了方便。它们也会提高伤害。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "756D4014FD40F166"
			min_width: 340
			shape: "star"
			size: 1.3d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FF6ECF>箭矢可选</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "74C3C223C7F42855"
				item: "mekaweapons:mekabow"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF6ECF to=#FFCBEF f=0.6>Meka-Bow</grad></shadow>"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>可穿戴的机械动力模组</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>其他章节里的都是基础设施。而这一部分才是你真正要穿戴的装备。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最后是 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>MekaSuit</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>Meka-Tool</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，它们能飞行、采矿、耕作、为你提供食物、替你呼吸、免疫岩浆伤害，还能让你瞬移一百格。两者都不是你一次性就能制作的直接升级版。它们都是框架，需要安装模块，而模块才是真正的力量所在。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三行字</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>左</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是普通装备包。喷气背包、潜水装备、自由跑者，以及六套可以在穿上套装前很久就能制作的盔甲和工具。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>正下方是MekaSuit，每件装备及其模块都陈列在一旁。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>右边</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是Meka-工具和Meka-武器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 模块安装在修改站中，之后可以将其取回。这里没有任何无法撤销的错误操作。"
				"{ \"text\": \"Back to Mekanism\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#3FA9C8\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"23983F4DC524B14B\" } }"
			]
