				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>给任何东西充能</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>1,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，消耗时间为 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>5,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 刻。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本章中几乎所有带电物品的配方里都有这个，而且它本身就是一个将电荷输送到偏远建筑的好方法。</grad></shadow>"
			]
