		{
			dependencies: ["48675A9FD82F6BD7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>飞行，廉价版</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可储存 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>24,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 氢气，并在 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>16</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个游戏刻内充满。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>三种模式。 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>普通模式</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>按住跳跃键即可攀爬， </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>悬停模式</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>保持高度并允许漂移，以及 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>关闭模式，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无任何效果。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>电解分离器分离氧气会免费获得氢气，所以燃料从来不是问题。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 悬浮模式加上家里的充能板，是此模组最大的生活质量飞跃。"
			]
