				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>潜水气瓶</grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>放在盔甲槽中，可储存 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>24,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 氧气。而 </grad><grad from=#7FE0B0 to=#D3FFE9 f=0.8>潜水面罩</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 则戴在头上。两者缺一不可。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>氧气是电解分离器产出的另一半，所以这基本是免费的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
