		{
			dependencies: ["48675A9FD82F6BD7"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>永不枯竭</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无需消耗箭矢，每发消耗 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>120</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，并可储存 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>120,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>开启火焰模式，所有箭矢都会点燃，每发箭矢的伤害变为 </grad><grad from=#F2C14E to=#FFE9AE f=0.8>1,200</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点。</grad></shadow>"
