		}
		{
			dependencies: ["48675A9FD82F6BD7"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>套装之前</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>MekanismTools 将大多数你已制作的金属转化为全套盔甲和工具，并为所有材质（包括原版材质）添加了 </grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>Paxel</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这些都无法与MekaSuit相媲美。它们都早于MekaSuit很久就能获得，而且其中几个还拥有其他地方找不到的额外加成。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>大致按顺序</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>青铜</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>青金石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是早期且便宜的选项。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>锇</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是主力，能提供额外的固定生命值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>钢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 是坚固的中间部分。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
