				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>轻便、快速，专为强力打击而非吸收冲击而设计。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>+7</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 套装的盔甲韧性及 </grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>+8</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 最大生命值。 </grad></shadow>"
