				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>+2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 头盔的幸运值和攻击伤害加成提高百分之 </grad><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>+3</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 三。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- 靴子提供 <c1><grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>+10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 闪避几率、<grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>+10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 移动速度以及 <grad from=#9AA6B0 to=#DCE4EA f=0.8>2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 次额外战斗检定。"
				"[间隔=3]"
