			description: [
				"## <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>空白</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锡、青铜锭和一张</grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>聚乙烯片</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>会一次性给你</grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>2个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本章的每个模块都是一个模块基础，并在其周围构建其他内容，所以要制作很多个。</grad></shadow>"
