		{
			dependencies: ["2D55EEFA50A842B1"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>工作台</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将MekaSuit部件或Meka-Tool放入一个槽位，模块放入另一个槽位，即可完成安装。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它靠能量运行，而且双向有效，所以把一个模块拉出来移到别的地方，除了时间外不消耗任何东西。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 大多数模块可以叠加。安装四个能量单元不等于安装一个，界面会显示每个模块的最大值。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:modification_station"
			id: "1DC3E183AA22A566"
			rewards: [{
				id: "669E5C459681227A"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.35d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#63D2FF to=#63D2FF>模组放入此处</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "15A7878DA8CB7963"
				item: "mekanism:modification_station"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6>修改站</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1DC3E183AA22A566"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>游戏中最好的盔甲</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"四件物品，分别是围绕 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>Polonium Pellets</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>Ultimate Control Circuits</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>Induction Cells</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>Polyethene Sheets</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 重建的每一件下界合金盔甲部件。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这套盔甲本身就能提供 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>20</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点护甲和 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>3</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点韧性。这已经优于下界合金了。之所以说“远不如”，是因为它获得能量后的表现。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>动力全套吸收了什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"当四块部件全部安装且储液罐充满时，它能将火焰、岩浆、坠落、冰冻、仙人掌、铁砧、闪电、凋零、龙息以及其他未明确规则的伤害减免至原来的 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>100%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>唯一例外是守卫的音爆，它只能吸收其中的 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>75</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 百分比。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>数字们</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个部件在加入模组前可储存 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>16,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，并以每刻 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>100,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的速度充电。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能量单元急剧上升，因此满载的护甲能容纳更多能量。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 空盔甲就是二十件没附魔的护甲。在门口放个充能板。"
			]
