		{
			dependencies: ["1DC3E183AA22A566"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>一格装下所有物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用钋丸、终极电路、感应线圈和塑料重建的原子分解器。</grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>开箱即得，内含镐、斧、铲、锄、剪刀和剑，拥有 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点额外伤害和 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点效率。这大致相当于钻石工具，但这并非最有趣的部分。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>数字们</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在模块和充能前可储存 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>16,000,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，每秒充能 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>100,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- 每挖掘一个方块获得 <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量，或使用丝绸之触获得 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>2,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 每造成 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点伤害恢复能量。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>1,000</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 能量/每次传送 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 方块，最多 </grad><grad from=#63D2FF to=#CDEFFF f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 方块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 十个模组可以装进去，组合方式决定了工具的类型。脉矿挖掘加上挖掘升级会变成剥离机。耕种加上收割会变成收割机。"
			]
